### General Variables
##########
DATA_DIR=/tmp/koios/data
LOG_DIR=/tmp/koios/logs



### Web Variables
##########
INGRESS_PORT=8001



### Database Variables
##########
KOIOS_DB_NAME=koios
KOIOS_DB_USER=koios
KOIOS_DB_PASS=changeme



### Koios Variables
##########
## Security
CSP_STYLE_SRC=self,nonce

## Logging
KOIOS_LOG_LEVEL=debug

## Default page. Usage: <project>:page
LANDINGPAGE_VIEW=home:home

## These paths are inside the container
KOIOS_DATA_PATH=/var/lib/koios/data/
KOIOS_MEDIA_PATH=/var/lib/koios/media/
KOIOS_LOG_PATH=/var/log/koios/
